  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-7-PPR-240001128</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-7" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">People-Centred Justice for Micro, Small, and Medium-sized
Enterprises (mSMEs) and the People Behind Them</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed programme aims to support a peaceful society where people can trust each other, and are empowered to access fair formal and informal services designed to meet their justice needs, in the sphere of work and business. With this programme, we aim to improve the legal conditions for mSMEs by addressing and/or preventing their most pressing legal problems. Paired with increased resolution rates for the legal disputes within and between mSMEs and an improved regulatory framework, this programme results in mSMEs having better chances to succeed and thereby improve employment and livelihoods for many (vulnerable) people, mostly in the informal sector.</narrative>
  </description>
